---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Schema Injection -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schemaGraph)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO BANNER --------------------------------------------------->
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Engine Oil Change Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · All Oil Grades · Genuine Filters · All Makes</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car Oil Change Dubai — Synthetic & Mineral Oil, From AED 89
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Dubai's heat eats engine oil faster than you think. Get a proper car oil change in Dubai at our Al Satwa workshop — right grade, right filter, full underbody check. In and out in under an hour. Mobile oil change also available at your home or office.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. INTRO SECTION ------------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section" id="why-oil-changes-matter">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-split">
                    <div class="dcrs-split__content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Why Oil Changes Matter More in Dubai</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car Oil Change Dubai — What UAE Heat Does to Engine Oil
                        </h2>
                        <div class="dcrs-prose">
                            <p>
                                Routine engine lubrication is the single most important factor in engine longevity, especially in Dubai's climate. Standard service intervals are calculated for moderate temperatures. Here in the UAE, where summer heat regularly exceeds 45°C, engine oil undergoes sustained thermal stress — antioxidants deplete faster, oil shears thin, and microscopic sludge accumulates quicker than the odometer would suggest.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Driving with degraded oil compromises the protective film on crankshaft journals, camshaft lobes, and piston rings. For Dubai drivers dealing with stop-and-go traffic, short urban trips, and extreme summer heat, a proactive oil change schedule is not optional — it is the cheapest engine insurance money can buy.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                At <a href="/" class="dcrs-inline-link">Dubai Car Repair Service</a> on 222 Al Satwa Road, every oil change includes verified viscosity matching (from 0W-20 for modern hybrids to specialized European formulations for BMW, Mercedes-Benz, Audi, and Volvo), gravity sump draining, OEM-spec filter replacement, and a full undercarriage leak inspection. Need the mechanic to come to you? Our <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car mechanic in Dubai</a> performs on-site oil changes at your home or office across the city.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Thinking about a full service while you're here? Ask us about our <a href="/car-maintenance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car servicing in Dubai</a> packages, which bundle oil change, filter replacement, fluid top-ups, and a vehicle health check into a single visit.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-split__visual">
                        <div class="dcrs-photo-card">
                            <img
                                src={service4Image.src}
                                alt="Mechanic draining engine oil and replacing filter during a car oil change at Dubai Car Repair Service Al Satwa"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                                loading="eager"
                                class="dcrs-photo-card__img"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-photo-badge">
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__value">AED 89+</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__label">Oil Change From</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. OIL TYPES EXPLAINED ------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="oil-types">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Oil Types Explained</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Which Engine Oil Does Your Car Need in Dubai?</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Using the wrong oil type or viscosity causes premature engine wear. Here is what we use and why.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-oils-grid">
                    {oils.map((o) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-oil-card">
                            <div class="dcrs-oil-card__header">
                                <div class={`dcrs-oil-card__icon ${o.badgeColor}`}>
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons[o.icon]} />
